      "kinds": "$kinds",
      "who": "$who",
      "paid_minor": "$paid_minor",
      "one_per_kind": "$one_per_kind",
      "business_sections": "$business_sections",
      "from_filed": "$from_filed",
      "vda_max": "$vda_max",
      "vehicles_max": "$vehicles_max",
      "cg_max": "$cg_max",
      "losses_max": "$losses_max",
      "gifts_max": "$gifts_max",
      "from_prev": "$from_prev",
      "biz_kinds": "$biz_kinds",
      "pl_as": "$pl_as",
      "pl_codes": "$pl_codes",
      "foreign_max": "$foreign_max",
      "fa_max": "$fa_max",
      "club_max": "$club_max",
      "arrears_max": "$arrears_max",
      "countries_from": "$countries_from",
      "tan_kinds": "$tan_kinds",
      "gst_max": "$gst_max",
      "itr3_cfl": "$itr3_cfl"
    }
  },
  "returns": "record",
  "version": 18,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "2026-10-06: what may be dropped in (types, size), how many houses, which filing kinds pay the late fee, the yes/no questions a person answers and their defaults, the five steps, and the documents asked for (need = the journey nudges for it). 2026-10-06: who - where a filed return (JSON) names the person, so a return can start from documents and the client is made from them. 2026-10-06: paid_minor - a payment typed on Check as its challan minor head (100 advance, 300 self-assessment). 2026-10-06: one_per_kind - a second AIS / 26AS / pre-filled JSON / filed return asks first: replace it (the old kept in History) or keep both. 2026-10-06: business_sections - TDS sections whose amount paid is a receipt of a business or profession (shown beside the receipts typed). 2026-10-06: .xls (an old Excel bank statement). 2026-10-06: from_filed - this year's filed return gives the filing date (Verification Date), the acknowledgement (its file name) and each challan (Schedule IT). 2026-10-06: karta_name / karta_pan / formed_on - an HUF's Karta signs its return; its date of formation stands where a person's birth date does. 2026-10-07: the person's address, city, PIN, e-mail and mobile (typed on Review when no document has them - a typed answer wins), the dates of winnings (lottery_on, games_on), vda_max, vehicles_max. 2026-10-07: cg_max / losses_max / gifts_max; filed_prev (last year's return) is one document; from_prev - its Schedule CFL. 2026-10-07: biz_kinds (business / profession on the person's own profit and loss, besides 44ADA / 44AD / 44AE); pl_as (their presumptive twin, for the limits and s.44AB(e)); pl_codes (their nature-of-business codes, from the ITR-3 schema). 2026-10-07: wave 3: residential-status questions (days in India this year / the 4 and 7 years before, years as a non-resident, citizen / person of Indian origin, visiting, left for a job, taxed elsewhere, income other than from foreign sources, country of residence and TIN); foreign_max / fa_max / club_max / arrears_max; countries_from. 2026-10-08: tan_kinds (a second Form 16 from the same employer), gst_max, itr3_cfl (losses from last year's ITR-3). 2026-10-13: supply: goods or services (the GST limit of a bank-only filing). 2026-10-13: supply.",
